{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yzbHmWdN6J1793788048.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>長沙灣發生持刀傷人案，一名男子受傷送院，另一名男子涉嫌傷人被捕。</p><p></p><p>現場是長沙大樓一個地舖。</p><p></p><p>有閉路電視片段見到，一名身穿白色上衣的男子，下午約三時走入一間雜貨店，一名穿綠色上衣的男子，雙手各持一把刀，突然衝出來，向白衣男子揮動，對方拿起地下的風扇遮擋。兩人糾纏期間，有其他人上前阻止，及取走該兩把刀。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WOUNDING-1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268zDoBvBBSv1793786161.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WOUNDING-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SDRMg9WUnk1793786175.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警員到場後圍封現場調查。<br/><br/>據了解，兩名涉案男子均屬非華裔，過往有積怨，事件中一名30多歲男子，頭部受傷，清醒送往明愛醫院治理。而涉嫌傷人被捕的男子，亦報稱受傷送院。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WOUNDING-1700_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QsJFOP8i4j1793786189.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:23.265157+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:31.725442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:22.570041+00:00","content_hash":"a3fb323695c9945e2ba61d561bf1940901d07b5c06a36ff7e25e18c8d3dbc094","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}